Reason: Both scripts return the same percentage, but 2result.sql is more robust:

• It adds a secondary ORDER BY on actor_id, giving deterministic results when rental counts tie.  
• It re‑uses the top‑5 list through a join instead of an IN‑subquery, keeping the logic clearer and avoiding duplication.  
• It isolates the total‑customer count in its own CTE (“tot”), making the final calculation explicit and easy to maintain.